         assistant and the clear/unreadable behaviour moved onto the surviving credential without
         the sentence it inherited being rewritten. -->
    <string name="settings_key_unreadable">The saved speech service key could not be read on this headset — enter it again.</string>
    <!-- The other kind of failure, and it is the one that used to destroy the key. A busy
