         what is already downloaded — the right call, and the reason 1.395 GB could accumulate
         with nothing listing it: the only removal resolved the SELECTED store and deleted that
         one file. Every string below names the whole shelf rather than one model. -->
    <string name="label_model_storage">Speech models on this headset</string>
