         flag nobody passed. It is read out over a call, so every field is positional and a
         translation may reorder them. -->
    <string name="settings_version">Fabric VR %1$s (%2$d) · %3$s · %4$s</string>
    <!-- true because: NotesViewModel.watchMirror — the first failure of an episode from
         VaultMirror.failures, once, with Settings as the action because that is where the count
